  "query_preview": "..\nKEY MESSAGE 1...Generally dry weather Sunday through late next \nweek.\n\nKEY MESSAGE 1 DESCRIPTION...\nA strong surface high pressure will elongate across the\nnortheastern United States beginning on Sunday and will \ngenerally control the weather through late next week. During \nthis time, several weak frontal passages will occur. However, \nwith only limited moisture available expect that the frontal \npassages will generally be dry. As the original high slides\neastward on Tuesday, additional ridging over southern Canada will\nmove into the region continuing the dry trend.",
